@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam roundCorner 10

title EduCore — Multi-Channel Announcement & Notification Pipeline

actor "Author (Admin/Lecturer)" as Author
actor "Recipient (Student/Faculty)" as Recipient
participant "EduCore Backend" as App
database "PostgreSQL DB" as DB
queue "Redis Queue" as Queue
cloud "Mail Server" as Mail
cloud "Telegram Bot API" as Telegram

== Announcement Authoring ==
Author -> App : Compose announcement (Audience: Students, Scheduled: Now)
App -> DB : Insert announcements record (status: published)
App -> Queue : Dispatch BroadcastAnnouncementJob

== Multi-Channel Fanout ==
Queue -> App : Process Job
App -> DB : Insert in-app notifications rows (unread)

alt User has Email Notifications enabled
  App -> Mail : Dispatch HTML announcement email
  Mail -> Recipient : Delivers to user inbox
end

alt User has linked Telegram account
  App -> Telegram : Dispatch Telegram bot alert message
  Telegram -> Recipient : Push notification on phone
end

== Read Receipt ==
Recipient -> App : Opens /announcements & reads post
App -> DB : Insert announcement_reads record (user_id, announcement_id, read_at)

@enduml
